  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN201.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">piriviṭai veṟupaṭṭa <app><lem>talaimakaṭkut</lem></app><rdg wit="#NL #C1 #C9">talaimakaṟkut</rdg> toḻi cŏlliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What the confidante said to HER who had undergone changes in the time of separation.</p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="AN201.1">
      <lg type="edition">
        <l>amma vāḻi tōḻi<anchor n="1"/> poṉṉi</l>
        <l>ṉavireḻi ṉuṭaṅku maṇikiḷa rōṭai</l>
        <l>viṉainavil yāṉai viṟaṟpōrp pāṇṭiyaṉ</l>
        <l>pukaḻmali ciṟappiṟ koṟkai muṉṟuṟai</l>
        <l>yavirkatir muttamoṭu valampuri corintu</l>
        <l>taḻaiyaṇip polinta kōṭēn talkuṟ</l>
        <l>paḻaiyar makaḷir paṉittuṟai paravap</l>
        <l>pakalōṉ maṟainta vanti yāriṭai</l>
        <l>yurukeḻu peruṅkaṭa luvavuk kiḷarntāṅ</l>
        <l>kalaru māṉṟu paṭṭaṉṟē yaṉṉaiyum</l>
        <l>poruntāk kaṇṇaḷ veyya vuyirkkumeṉ</l>
        <l><supplied>ṟeva</supplied>ṉkai <supplied>ya</supplied>ṟṟaṉai yikuḷai cōḻar</l>
        <l>veṇṇel vaippi ṉaṉṉāṭu peṟiṉu</l>
        <l>māṇṭamain tuṟaikuna rallar muṉātu</l>
        <l>vāṉpuku talaiya kuṉṟattuk kavāaṟ</l>
        <l>peruṅkai yeṇkiṉ pēḻvā yēṟṟai</l>
        <l>yiruṭuṇin taṉṉa kuvavumayirk kuruḷai<del>n</del>t</l>
        <l>tōṉmulaip piṇavoṭu tiḷaikkum</l>
        <l>vēṉi ṉīṭiya curaṉiṟan tōrē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="1a-c 11d">Alas, oh friend, saying</l>
        <l corresp="9">“like the full moon emerging from the fearful great ocean,</l>
        <l corresp="8">in the difficult time of twilight when the day-maker vanishes,</l>
        <l corresp="7">while on the chilly ghat the women of the toddy sellers rever [it],</l>
        <l corresp="6">[their] eminent hips with curves that are luxuriant with leaf decorations,</l>
        <l corresp="5">pouring forth right-spiralling conches along with pearls with shining rays</l>
        <l corresp="4">on the front ghat of Koṟkai with famous excellence,</l>
        <l corresp="3">of the Pāṇṭiya of victorious battle, [his] work-trained elephants</l>
        <l corresp="1d-2">with gem-gleaming caparisons that sway with the shining beauty of gold,</l>
        <l>gossip arose in a muddled way, and mother</l>
        <l corresp="10f">sighs hotly, [her] eyes not closing”,</l>
        <l>why are you prostrate, friend? Even if </l>
        <l corresp="12f">he were to obtain the good land of the Cōḻas in the region of white paddy,</l>
        <l corresp="14a-c">he would not remain content there,</l>
        <l corresp="14d 19">– he who earlier traversed the extended desert of summer,</l>
        <l corresp="15">where on the slope of hills whose peaks reach the sky</l>
        <l corresp="16">the large-mouthed male of the big-clawed bear</l>
        <l corresp="17f">[and with its] female with skinny teats.</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

